# Parley mail users: name , password , permissions , parameters
# Managed by parley-mail-admin (the Users page). One user per line:
#   tony@example.com , {PBKDF2}... , READ|WRITE , maildrop=example.com/tony
# READ: log in and read mail. WRITE: delete and file mail, and send it. ADMIN: use parley-mail-admin.
# A name with a domain (tony@example.com) gets mail for that domain only; a name without one
# gets mail for every local domain.
